# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf — this app is developed on Windows but
# CI/most tooling (ruff, prettier, git diffs) expects LF, and without this
# a Windows checkout's CRLF conversion fights ruff format's LF output on
# every run.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch line endings in files where they're meaningful/binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
